{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"de Rham 上同调"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"deRham上同调"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>代数簇 (或代数几何中更一般的几何对象) 的 <strong>De Rham 上同调</strong>是 "},{"Local":{"url":"deRham复形","text":"de Rham 复形"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"超上同调","text":"超上同调"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>对于好的代数簇, 例如光滑紧合的代数簇, 其 de Rham 上同调等同于其解析化后的 de Rham 上同调.</p>\n"}]}}